{"2537020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ShelfLife: Art School Detective", "steam_appid": 2537020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4757360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THERE'S AN <strong>ART KILLER</strong> ON THE LOOSE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Johana is a Psychic Art Student trying to solve the MURDER of several priceless artworks! Johana will need to gather clues, astral project, and <strong>INVESTI</strong>-<strong>DATE</strong> 9 suspects, each with their own motives and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But time is short! If Johana can't find the real ART KILLER, Cruston Beaux-Arts Academy will be demolished, along with Johana's dreams of being an artist! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of ART is  at stake (probably), so it's time to solve the case...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/fe92e840249e8e5445115886d3750900.poster.avif?t=1785974980\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/fe92e840249e8e5445115886d3750900.webm?t=1785974980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/fe92e840249e8e5445115886d3750900.mp4?t=1785974980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Art School Weirdos to <strong>INVESTI-DATE!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Clues</strong>, inspect <strong>Evidence</strong> and make <strong>Deductions</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a cosy University Town set in fictional New Zealand. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Psychic powers. Delve into the mixed-media <strong>Artworld</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make choices</strong> and <strong>discover different routes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bop along to an Indie Bedroom Pop Soundtrack! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/287849a8e3bbb377072db4c91d2b512b.poster.avif?t=1785974980\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/287849a8e3bbb377072db4c91d2b512b.webm?t=1785974980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/287849a8e3bbb377072db4c91d2b512b.mp4?t=1785974980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ShelfLife: Art School Detective is a Detective Dating Sim that emphasises relationship-building, exploration, and psychic powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build connections with <strong>9</strong> potential suspects. Astral project into The Artworld to uncover  characters’ secrets. Collect  evidence to unmask the mysterious &quot;ART KILLER&quot; before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/54bcaf819006a15b88036fb9b7c54767.poster.avif?t=1785974980\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537020/extras/54bcaf819006a15b88036fb9b7c54767.webm?t=1785974980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: